  {
   "id": "south-park-snow-day-261145@patch-2024-10-30",
   "gameId": "south-park-snow-day-261145",
   "displayName": "New Patch Live Now!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-30T14:06:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our latest update brings a host of thrilling enhancements and content additions:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toggle Enemy BS Animation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Now, the enemy battle sequence animation is switched off for faster, smoother gameplay experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DLC Expansion",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• If purchased, Nichole's Home Brew is now available in all maps of the free DLC \"To Danse with Ravenous Shadows\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Expand your Brain",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Customize your character even further with increased perk tree capacity from 30 to 36, offering more freedom in skill development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Introducing - New Perks that unlock three new ally companions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Barbarian Battle Buddy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there is room in your party, a mighty Barbarian joins you in battle! Uses a Battleaxe, Bull Rush, Fart Escape.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Amazing Wizard's Apprentice",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there is room in your party, a powerful Wizard joins you in battle! Using a Staff, Gravity Bomb, Bubble Shield, and a Bullshit Power.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Tactical Tree Hugger",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there is room in your party, a crafty Ranger joins you in battle! Uses Bow & Daggers, Drones, Snowball Turrets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimizations & Balancing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Enjoy smoother gameplay with several bug fixes, optimizations, and balance improvements for a better, more refined experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• DLC update: Nichole’s Horns are now unlocked correctly when all chapters are completed with two Brews active.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Issues that caused loss of progress were fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
